{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "Hello support, I am trying to set up some new appointment categories for our schedule here at the clinic, but I am running into a snag. I went into the settings and created a custom visit type with its own duration and color coding, but when I look at the main booking screen, it is completely missing. I already checked the provider scheduling templates to make sure it was enabled there, but it still will not show up for us to select. Could you let me know what I am missing in the configuration menu so we can start using these new types?",
   "id": "gen-011",
   "subject": "Custom appointment types not showing on booking screen"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi there, I am trying to find where we can pull the logs showing who looked at patient charts recently for our annual checkup, but I am totally lost in the menus. Can you point me to the right section or send instructions on how to export this data?",
   "id": "gen-012",
   "subject": "Finding security audit logs"
  },
  {
   "body": "This online scheduling configuration is driving me crazy. We are trying to let patients book routine slots through the web portal, but every time I save the settings, it opens up every single appointment type for all of our providers instead of just the ones we selected. I have tried toggling the restrictions off and on three different times, and it keeps resetting itself. Can someone please look at our portal rules and fix whatever is overriding my changes?",
   "id": "gen-013",
   "subject": "Online booking rules resetting on their own"
  },
  {
   "body": "We generated the monthly patient statements this morning, and it appears that several PDF attachments went out to incorrect email addresses due to a merge glitch. I need to know how to retract these statements immediately and verify how many accounts were impacted by this error.",
   "id": "gen-014",
   "subject": "Incorrect statements sent out"
  },
  {
   "body": "Please provide guidance on how to properly post an electronic remittance advice and reallocate payments that were incorrectly applied across multiple line items on an invoice.",
   "id": "gen-015",
   "subject": "Question regarding remittance and payment posting"
  },
  {
   "body": "Good morning, I am working on getting our electronic lab ordering workflow sorted out across the practice, but I hit a roadblock with some rejected requisitions. When I navigate to the diagnostic orders tab and click into the failed transmission queue, the error codes just say generic failure without explaining why the ICD-10 codes or test panels were rejected by the reference lab. I tried updating the diagnosis pointers on a few test orders and resubmitting them, but they bounced back again instantly. Could you walk me through how to properly clear these out and successfully transmit them?",
   "id": "gen-016",
   "subject": "Troubleshooting electronic lab requisition rejections"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello support team, I am reviewing our internal workflows and would like to ensure our audit log configurations are set up correctly for compliance tracking across our medium-sized practice. Specifically, I want to confirm how long system access logs are retained by default and whether our current enterprise tier allows us to export these detailed chart-access histories into a CSV format for our upcoming review. Could you provide instructions or let me know if a system administrator needs to enable a specific toggle for this feature to become active?",
   "id": "gen-017",
   "subject": "Reviewing system audit logs and export options"
  },
  {
   "body": "Please advise on the correct procedure for configuring threshold parameters and notification rules for critical laboratory values within the system settings.",
   "id": "gen-018",
   "subject": "Critical lab notification thresholds setup"
  },
  {
   "body": "All of our providers lost their custom medication favorite lists following the latest system patch. This is completely disrupting our prescribing workflow during patient visits. We need these preference lists restored immediately or clear instructions on how to rebuild them without manually searching every single drug again.",
   "id": "gen-019",
   "subject": "Missing medication favorites after update"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, could you please provide instructions on how to adjust the delayed release timers for sensitive diagnostic results on the patient portal?",
   "id": "gen-020",
   "subject": "Portal result release timer configuration"
  }
 ]
}
